---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const pageTitle = '48 Hours in California';
const pageDescription =
  'Practical 48-hour California travel itineraries and weekend getaway guides.';
---

<Base title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <section>
    <p>Practical California Getaways</p>

    <h1>48 Hours in California</h1>

    <h2>Two days. One California getaway. Make the most of it.</h2>

    <p>
      Practical two-day itineraries for California escapes—where to stay,
      what to see, where to eat, and how to spend your time without spending
      hours planning the trip.
    </p>

    <a href="/itineraries/">Explore 48-Hour Getaways</a>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p>Featured Getaway</p>

    <h2>48 Hours in Paso Robles</h2>

    <img
      src="/images/paso-robles-vineyard-hero.jpg"
      alt="Vineyard landscape in Paso Robles wine country"
      style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"
    />

    <p>
      Wine country without trying to see everything. Spend two days exploring
      downtown Paso Robles, nearby wineries, good food, and the landscape that
      makes this part of California worth slowing down for.
    </p>

    <a href="/itineraries/paso-robles/">
      Plan 48 Hours in Paso Robles
    </a>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p>Find Your Kind of Getaway</p>

    <h2>Choose Your California Escape</h2>

    <p>
      Start with the kind of weekend you have in mind, then find a
      48-hour getaway that fits.
    </p>

    <div>
      <h3>Wine Country</h3>
      <p>
        Vineyards, tasting rooms, good food, and California landscapes
        made for slowing down.
      </p>
      <a href="/destinations/">Explore Wine Country</a>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3>The California Coast</h3>
      <p>
        Beaches, harbors, ocean views, and memorable stops along
        California's coastline.
      </p>
      <a href="/destinations/">Explore the Coast</a>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3>California Towns &amp; Cities</h3>
      <p>
        Walkable downtowns, local restaurants, history, and places worth
        spending a weekend getting to know.
      </p>
      <a href="/destinations/">Explore Towns &amp; Cities</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p>More California Getaways</p>

    <h2>Find Your Next 48 Hours</h2>

    <p>
      From small coastal towns to wine country and classic California
      destinations, there is always another weekend worth considering.
    </p>

    <div>
      <img
        src="/images/cambria-moonstone-beach.jpg"
        alt="Moonstone Beach along the Cambria coastline"
        style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"
      />
      <h3>Cambria</h3>
      <a href="/itineraries/cambria/">Explore Cambria</a>
    </div>

    <div>
      <img
        src="/images/monterey-harbor-hero.jpg"
        alt="Monterey Harbor on the California coast"
        style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"
      />
      <h3>Monterey</h3>
      <a href="/itineraries/monterey/">Explore Monterey</a>
    </div>

    <div>
      <img
        src="/images/big-sur-highway-1-hero.jpg"
        alt="Highway 1 along the Big Sur coastline"
        style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"
      />
      <h3>Big Sur</h3>
      <a href="/itineraries/big-sur/">Explore Big Sur</a>
    </div>

    <div>
      <img
        src="/images/santa-barbara-hero.jpg"
        alt="Santa Barbara on the California coast"
        style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"
      />
      <h3>Santa Barbara</h3>
      <a href="/itineraries/santa-barbara/">Explore Santa Barbara</a>
    </div>

    <div>
      <img
        src="/images/santa-cruz-boardwalk.jpg"
        alt="Santa Cruz Beach Boardwalk"
        style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"
      />
      <h3>Santa Cruz</h3>
      <a href="/itineraries/santa-cruz/">Explore Santa Cruz</a>
    </div>

    <div>
      <img
        src="/images/sonoma-bedrock-vineyard.jpg"
        alt="Vineyard landscape in Sonoma wine country"
        style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"
      />
      <h3>Sonoma</h3>
      <a href="/itineraries/sonoma/">Explore Sonoma</a>
    </div>

    <p>
      <a href="/itineraries/">View All 48-Hour Getaways</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  section {
    margin-bottom: 72px;
  }

  section > p:first-child {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  section > img {
    margin: 24px 0;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  section > div {
    margin: 32px 0;
  }

  section > div img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 280px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  section > div h3 {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    section:last-of-type {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 32px;
    }

    section:last-of-type > p,
    section:last-of-type > h2 {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    section:last-of-type > div {
      margin: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
